\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 I started calling relatives, coworkers, anyone I could think of who knew him. And that's when I learned that he'd been working for a satellite imaging company on a contract with the Department of Defense.}{\rtlch\afs24
\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2
